================================================================================
Specifications implemented or profiled
================================================================================

This work implements, profiles, or extends the following specifications. They
are cited as normative references; no specification text is reproduced here
beyond brief quotation for identification.

  User-Managed Access (UMA) 2.0 Grant for OAuth 2.0 Authorization
  Federated Authorization for UMA 2.0
      Kantara Initiative. https://docs.kantarainitiative.org/uma/

  RFC 9728  OAuth 2.0 Protected Resource Metadata
  RFC 9421  HTTP Message Signatures
  RFC 7638  JSON Web Key (JWK) Thumbprint
      IETF. Reproduced under the IETF Trust Legal Provisions.

  AAuth Protocol (draft-hardt-oauth-aauth-protocol), and the companion
  AAuth R3 and Bootstrap drafts
      Dick Hardt. https://github.com/dickhardt/AAuth

  IEEE Std 7012-2025, Standard for Machine Readable Personal Privacy Terms
  ("MyTerms")
      IEEE Standards Association. Cited by section; the standard itself is
      published by IEEE and is not redistributed with this work.

